  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Card Casting drawback, any metamagic feat</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may apply metamagic feats to effect cards as part of playing them even if the card did not originally have the metamagic feats written into its effects (you must spend additional spell points as normal). When you play an effect card with metamagic effects written on the card, you do not increase the casting time as a result of applying a metamagic feat.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/card-and-deck-feats#toc23\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
